ifier-free-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e318e28bff8754a3\" href=\"?note=e318e28bff8754a3\" title=\"17-df-quantifier-elimination\">17-df-quantifier-elimination</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"31cb5bc79934e98e\" href=\"?note=31cb5bc79934e98e\" title=\"17-df-formula-consequence\">17-df-formula-consequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3eb5325f08c84582\" href=\"?note=3eb5325f08c84582\" title=\"17-df-symbols\">17-df-symbols</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QFForm}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{QFForm}_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QE}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{QE}_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e272cfe8553473c0\" href=\"?note=e272cfe8553473c0\" title=\"17-df-quantifier-free-formula\">17-df-quantifier-free-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e318e28bff8754a3\" href=\"?note=e318e28bff8754a3\" title=\"17-df-quantifier-elimination\">17-df-quantifier-elimination</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_T\">\\(\\equiv_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"31cb5bc79934e98e\" href=\"?note=31cb5bc79934e98e\" title=\"17-df-formula-consequence\">17-df-formula-consequence</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\">\\(\\exists\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3eb5325f08c84582\" href=\"?note=3eb5325f08c84582\" title=\"17-df-symbols\">17-df-symbols</a> 的缩写。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl[\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{QFForm}_L\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{QFForm}_L\\;((\\exists x\\,\\theta)\\equiv_T\\psi)\\bigr]\n\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\\operatorname{QE}_L(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl[\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{QFForm}_L\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{QFForm}_L\\;((\\exists x\\,\\theta)\\equiv_T\\psi)\\bigr]\n\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\\operatorname{QE}_L(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书 Lemma 1.5.1 在基本公式取原子公式时的特例。证明：必要性直接应用 QE；充分性对公式构造归纳，否定和蕴涵保持等价，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\,\\varphi\">\\(\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\)</span> 展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists x\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\neg\\exists x\\neg\\varphi\\)</span> 后用假设。原书 p.50 的归纳证明已读。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-quantifier-free-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e272cfe8553473c0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-quantifier-free-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-quantifier-elimination","status":"resolved","id":"e318e28bff8754a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-quantifier-elimination]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"31cb5bc79934e98e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-formula-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-symbols","status":"resolved","id":"3eb5325f08c84582","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-symbols]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-quantifier-free-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e272cfe8553473c0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$；$\\m