":1476,"backlinks":[{"id":"cbf4219cf8e62a0e","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"对应原书 Theorem 1.5.3；pp.51–53 的证明已读。有限个变量的等式/严格序型给出有限析取范式。消去一个存在变量时，等式分支可代入；严格上下界分支由稠密性及无端点性实现；无剩余变量时可返回恒真 $v_0=v_0$ 或恒假 $\\neg(v_0=v_0)$。[[17-lem-quantifier-elimination-test]] 完成结构归纳。"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-245","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-lem-isomorphism-satisfaction]]\n[[17-lem-quantifier-elimination-test]]\n[[17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence]]\n[[17-lem-universal-consequences-extension]]"}],"outgoing":["e272cfe8553473c0","e318e28bff8754a3","31cb5bc79934e98e","3eb5325f08c84582"]}